Owns: the exact production stage order, materialized source cost, trace-reconciled
low-norm estimate, and diagnostic Poseidon2 census for fifteen rho samples.

Does not own: absorbed label/field conformance, counter-value conformance, the
Poseidon2 function, sampler correctness, a materialized low-norm relation, or
permission to remove rows.

Emits constraints: no.

Authority boundary: source counts come from the satisfied production R1CS.
Estimated counts come from the validated profiler and remain estimator-only.
No digest authorizes any field below.

| Data branch | Meaning | Evidence tier |
|---|---|---|
| `samples` | ordered 15-by-4 production checkpoints | diagnostic stage trace |
| `materializedSource*` | rows/columns emitted by the satisfied source builder | materialized source R1CS |
| `estimatedLowNorm*` | compact compiler cost model | trace-reconciled estimate only |
| `tracedPoseidon*` | nonlinear events attributed to exact source ranges | diagnostic nonlinear trace |
-/

